> License, but only in their entirety and only with respect to the Combined\r\n> Software.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2301488709/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2301492968","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2531#issuecomment-2301492968","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2531","id":2301492968,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86JLf7o","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-08-21T08:41:44Z","updated_at":"2024-08-21T08:41:44Z","body":"**{metæffekt} Universe**\r\ncanonical name: [Apache Patent Provision Exception](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[a]/README.md#user-content-Apache-Patent-Provision-Exception:~:text=Apache%20Patent%20Provision%20Exception)\r\nshort name: Apache-Patent-Exception\r\ncategory: Apache Patent Provision Exception\r\nScanCode reference id: [apache-patent-exception](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/apache-patent-exception.LICENSE)\r\nOSI status: _none_\r\n\r\n**ScanCode**\r\nmatched id: apache-2.0 WITH generic-exception\r\n\r\n**Comment**\r\nPlease note that exception is explicitly dealing with patents. Simply naming it a \"linking exception\" I do not regard a valid approach. So I'm proposing to use the (canonical) name and short name as we have derived. +1 to add.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2301492968/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2394788480","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2531#issuecomment-2394788480","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2531","id":2394788480,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86OvZKA","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-04T23:33:24Z","updated_at":"2024-10-04T23:33:24Z","body":"Note also the complication that there is a [separate text](https://github.com/michaelrsweet/mxml/tree/master?tab=readme-ov-file#legal-stuff) in the README.md file of the same project that basically says the exception is removable (in the manner of typical GPL exceptions, I guess). See https://gitlab.com/fedora/legal/fedora-license-data/-/issues/549#note_2116790301\r\n \r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2394788480/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2427785833","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2531#issuecomment-2427785833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2531","id":2427785833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86QtRJp","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url"